# Class / subject / project folders are named by slug. Re-include slugs that the repo's
# parent .gitignore files would otherwise drop (a subject called "Build" -> build/).
!build/
!dist/
!out/
!env/
!ENV/
!venv/
!htmlcov/
!logs/
!coverage/
!turbo/
# Atomic-write temp files (.<name>.<pid>.tmp) and editor noise.
.*.tmp
.DS_Store
